# the child closes the CLOEXEC control writer at exec. The drain must
# treat the reset as "no data this tick", not invalidate the channel:
# without this, every macOS session fails closed with 125.
reader, writer = module.protocol_socketpair(module.socket.SOCK_DGRAM)
